    description: "Adjacent finding of audit-findings 0021 (Step 5). Filed, not moved.\nThe community overlay io_primitives_overlays/elixir-web-and-db.yaml rows Oban.insert / insert! / insert_all under ipc_send (\"Oban job queue -- enqueue background jobs\"). Oban persists jobs in a database table (PostgreSQL / SQLite / MySQL via Ecto); the crossing at the call is a database insert, which the axis spells db_write.\nCommunity tier (ADR-0061): the row only ADDS findings, so the defect is the zone (ipc instead of database), not a false all-clear.\nFix shape: re-point to db_write in the overlay; check whether the overlay's other Ecto rows already use db_write for the same shape."  # 884b
